      "en": {
        "name": "BroneTorg BTSh-6 \"Sapsan\" high cut helmet",
        "shortName": "BTSh-6",
        "description": "The BTSh-6 \"Sapsan\" helmet is a Russian-made clone of the ever-popular FAST XP (\"Extra Protection\") shell, designed to be lightweight and provide ample protection. Compared to the Ops-Core counterpart, it provides somewhat lesser protection but overall will still protect the user from shrapnel and some small-caliber rounds. Manufactured by BroneTorg. Olive Drab version."
      }
