    "locales": {
      "en": {
        "name": "Galvion Batlskin Viper P2 high-cut helmet",
        "shortName": "Viper P2",
        "description": "A lightweight high-cut ballistic helmet engineered for modern combat systems, the Viper P2 \"Mission Ready+\" offers optimized coverage while maintaining a low profile. Constructed from advanced composite materials, it balances protection and weight, and features integrated ARC rails and a front NVG shroud for mounting accessories. Its high-cut design improves headset compatibility and situational awareness, making it well-suited for modular, mission-adaptable loadouts."
